---
/** Large centred statement, e.g. the one-line pitch under the hero. */
---
<p class="lead"><slot /></p>

<style>
  .lead {
    margin: 2rem auto;
    max-width: 52rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1440px) { .lead { font-size: 2.5rem; } }
</style>
